  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Modern minimal glass, original product evidence",
    "overview": "Wide, light-weight sans typography and generous whitespace establish identity quickly for recruiters, design leaders and hiring teams. Floating frosted navigation and restrained artifact frames introduce depth; the original screenshots stay unobscured.",
